{%- comment -%}
  theinmag-shop-grid
  Filterable product grid for /shop page. Renders the configured collection
  via the extended theinmag-bundle-tile snippet (context: 'shop').

  Filter row: Format (All / Print / Digital). Filter is COVER-ONLY - it
  swaps which cover image is visible on each tile but does NOT filter the
  product list. Print + Digital rows always render both formats. Mechanic:
  JS toggles data-active-format on the <ul>; CSS rules on the tile show/hide
  the right cover image via parent attribute selectors. Pattern matches the
  single-mag PDP iPad-mockup swap and the BaB picker's Format toggle.

  Sort: client-side via data attributes (price + created_at on each <li>).
  Server-side renders all products in collection order; sort options
  re-order the DOM nodes in place. Sort options:
    featured       - default, server-side collection order
    newest         - by product.created_at DESC
    price-asc      - by price ASC
    price-desc     - by price DESC

  Show more: first N products (default 12) render visible, remainder
  render with the [hidden] attribute. Show-more button reveals the next
  N hidden items each click. No AJAX, no infinite scroll - SEO + LCP wins.

  Add-to-cart: tiles fire data-shop-add which this section's JS handles
  via fetch -> /cart/add.js. Button label flips to "Added ✓" for 1.6s then
  back to "Add". On error the button reads "Try again". No cart drawer
  re-render is handled here; the storefront cart count badge picks it up
  on the next page load.

  Also emits the page-level ItemList JSON-LD for SEO (full product list
  with position + URL + name + image + price). The hero section emits
  BreadcrumbList + CollectionPage at the top of the page.

  Spec: Stage 5 build brief Part 3.4.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign collection_handle = section.settings.collection_handle | default: 'all'
  assign target_collection = collections[collection_handle]
  assign products_per_page = section.settings.products_per_page | default: 12
  assign heading = section.settings.heading | default: 'Shop everything'
  assign empty_text = section.settings.empty_text | default: 'No mags available right now. Check back soon.'

  # Print-available-only filter (stockist hub). When on, a product is only
  # rendered if it has at least one AVAILABLE variant whose title is NOT
  # "digital". This single rule drops digital-only mags, print-sold-out
  # issues and the Digital Stack, while keeping in-stock print mags + the
  # Snack Pack (its sole "Default Title" variant is non-digital) and any
  # pre-sale issue (its print variant reads available). Membership is still
  # excluded by handle via exclude_handles. Variant classification mirrors
  # theinmag-bundle-tile (scan variant titles for "print"/"digital").
  assign print_available_only = section.settings.print_available_only | default: false

  # Format filter pills are pointless on an all-print page, so they can be
  # hidden independently. Sort + Show-more are unaffected.
  assign show_format_filter = section.settings.show_format_filter
  if show_format_filter == nil
    assign show_format_filter = true
  endif

  assign show_character = section.settings.show_character

  # Handles to skip in the grid (comma-separated). Defaults exclude the
  # deprecated single-mags / single-issues umbrella product left over from
  # before the Stage 4 per-issue refactor. Both candidate handles are
  # listed so whichever one the umbrella actually uses gets filtered;
  # neither matches a real individual mag (mag01..N) so there's no risk
  # of hiding a real product.
  assign exclude_handles = section.settings.exclude_handles | default: '' | split: ','

  # Per-product cover overrides (comma-separated "handle:filename" pairs).
  # When a product's handle matches, the tile shows that /assets/ image as
  # its print cover instead of the product's featured image - lets the grid
  # carry a curated cover without changing the product image in admin.
  assign cover_overrides = section.settings.cover_overrides | default: '' | split: ','

  # Same pattern for the DIGITAL cover. Used when a product has no
  # single_mag.digital_media_images metafield (e.g. Membership) so the
  # tile still has an image to swap to under the Digital filter.
  assign digital_cover_overrides = section.settings.digital_cover_overrides | default: '' | split: ','

  # Handles to promote in the PRINT order. Comma-separated. When the
  # format filter switches to Print, these products jump up the grid
  # to a slot just below the most recent issues (so back-catalogue mags
  # we still have print stock for don't get stranded at the bottom).
  # Cover-only print filter; the tile list itself is unchanged.
  assign print_promote_handles = section.settings.print_promote_handles | default: '' | split: ','

  # Anchor matches for the custom grid order, matched against product.title.
  # Title is more stable than handle here - the store has handles set
  # inconsistently (digital-stack / mag10 / membership have no prefix, but
  # titles reliably read "theINmag - Digital Stack" etc). Theme editor
  # settings so they can be corrected without a code push.
  assign membership_match = section.settings.membership_match | default: 'Membership'
  assign snack_pack_match = section.settings.snack_pack_match | default: 'Snack Pack'
  assign digital_stack_match = section.settings.digital_stack_match | default: 'Digital Stack'

  # Build a sortable "WEIGHT:handle" list. Weights are 4-digit zero-padded
  # so a plain string sort is also a numeric sort. Sorted descending the
  # final grid order is: Membership, Snack Pack, mags newest-first, any
  # other product, then Digital Stack last.
  #   Membership    9999
  #   Snack Pack    9998
  #   MagNN         3000 + NN   (Mag10 = 3010, Mag01 = 3001)
  #   other         2000
  #   Digital Stack 1000
  #
  # A parallel print_sort_keys list is also built. It uses 5-digit
  # weights (default x10) so promoted handles can slot between mags
  # without colliding. Promoted weight 30085 = between Mag09 (30090)
  # and Mag08 (30080), i.e. just under the current + pre-sale issues.
  assign sort_keys = ''
  assign print_sort_keys = ''
  for product in target_collection.products
    assign is_excluded = false
    for h in exclude_handles
      assign h_trim = h | strip
      if h_trim != blank and h_trim == product.handle
        assign is_excluded = true
      endif
    endfor
    if print_available_only and is_excluded == false
      assign has_available_print = false
      for v in product.variants
        if v.available
          assign vt_dn = v.title | downcase
          unless vt_dn contains 'digital'
            assign has_available_print = true
          endunless
        endif
      endfor
      unless has_available_print
        assign is_excluded = true
      endunless
    endif
    unless is_excluded
      assign weight = '2000'
      if product.title contains membership_match
        assign weight = '9999'
      elsif product.title contains snack_pack_match
        assign weight = '9998'
      elsif product.title contains digital_stack_match
        assign weight = '1000'
      else
        assign handle_prefix = product.handle | slice: 0, 3
        if handle_prefix == 'mag'
          assign mag_num = product.handle | slice: 3, 5 | times: 1
          assign weight = 3000 | plus: mag_num | append: ''
        endif
      endif

      assign is_print_promoted = false
      for h in print_promote_handles
        assign h_trim = h | strip
        if h_trim != blank and h_trim == product.handle
          assign is_print_promoted = true
        endif
      endfor
      if is_print_promoted
        assign print_weight = '30085'
      else
        assign print_weight = weight | times: 10 | append: ''
      endif

      assign sort_keys = sort_keys | append: weight | append: ':' | append: product.handle | append: ','
      assign print_sort_keys = print_sort_keys | append: print_weight | append: ':' | append: product.handle | append: ','
    endunless
  endfor
  assign sorted_keys = sort_keys | split: ',' | sort | reverse
  assign sorted_print_keys = print_sort_keys | split: ',' | sort | reverse
  assign render_count = sorted_keys.size

  assign section_style = '--tsg-pt: ' | append: section.settings.padding_top | append: 'px; --tsg-pb: ' | append: section.settings.padding_bottom | append: 'px;'
-%}

<section
  class="theinmag-shop-grid"
  data-theinmag-shop-grid
  id="shop-grid"
  aria-labelledby="theinmag-shop-grid-heading"
  style="{{ section_style }}"
>
  <div class="theinmag-shop-grid__inner">

    <div class="theinmag-shop-grid__head">
      <h2 id="theinmag-shop-grid-heading" class="theinmag-shop-grid__heading">{{ heading }}</h2>

      {%- if render_count > 0 -%}
        <div class="theinmag-shop-grid__controls" role="group" aria-label="Filter and sort the product grid">

          {%- if show_format_filter -%}
          <div class="theinmag-shop-grid__filters" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Filter by format">
            <span class="theinmag-shop-grid__filter-label">Format</span>
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-shop-grid__filter-pill" data-format-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-shop-grid__filter-pill" data-format-filter="print" aria-pressed="false">Print</button>
            <button type="button" class="theinmag-shop-grid__filter-pill" data-format-filter="digital" aria-pressed="false">Digital</button>
          </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          <div class="theinmag-shop-grid__sort">
            <label for="shop-grid-sort" class="theinmag-shop-grid__sort-label">Sort</label>
            <select id="shop-grid-sort" class="theinmag-shop-grid__sort-select" data-sort>
              <option value="featured">Featured</option>
              <option value="newest">Newest first</option>
              <option value="price-asc">Price low to high</option>
              <option value="price-desc">Price high to low</option>
            </select>
          </div>

        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if show_character -%}
        {% render 'theinmag-character-pool' %}
        <span class="theinmag-shop-grid__character" data-theinmag-pool-character></span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if render_count > 0 -%}
      <p class="theinmag-shop-grid__count" data-count-line>
        Showing <span data-visible-count>{% if render_count > products_per_page %}{{ products_per_page }}{% else %}{{ render_count }}{% endif %}</span> of {{ render_count }}
      </p>

      <ul class="theinmag-shop-grid__list" data-shop-grid-list data-active-format="all" role="list">
        {%- assign visible_index = 0 -%}
        {%- for key in sorted_keys -%}
          {%- assign key_handle = key | split: ':' | last -%}
          {%- assign product = all_products[key_handle] -%}
          {%- if product == blank or product.id == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- assign visible_index = visible_index | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- comment -%} Resolve per-product cover overrides (print + digital), if set. {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign tile_cover = '' -%}
          {%- for pair in cover_overrides -%}
            {%- assign pair_handle = pair | split: ':' | first | strip -%}
            {%- if pair_handle != blank and pair_handle == product.handle -%}
              {%- assign tile_cover = pair | split: ':' | last | strip -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- assign tile_digital_cover = '' -%}
          {%- for pair in digital_cover_overrides -%}
            {%- assign pair_handle = pair | split: ':' | first | strip -%}
            {%- if pair_handle != blank and pair_handle == product.handle -%}
              {%- assign tile_digital_cover = pair | split: ':' | last | strip -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- comment -%} Resolve this product's position in the print-mode order. {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign tile_print_index = 0 -%}
          {%- for pkey in sorted_print_keys -%}
            {%- assign pkey_handle = pkey | split: ':' | last -%}
            {%- if pkey_handle == key_handle -%}
              {%- assign tile_print_index = forloop.index0 -%}
              {%- break -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          <li
            class="theinmag-shop-grid__item"
            data-tile-index="{{ visible_index | minus: 1 }}"
            data-tile-print-index="{{ tile_print_index }}"
            data-product-price="{{ product.price }}"
            data-product-created="{{ product.created_at | date: '%s' }}"
            {%- if visible_index > products_per_page %} hidden data-overflow{%- endif %}
          >
            {% render 'theinmag-bundle-tile', product: product, context: 'shop', cover_filename: tile_cover, digital_cover_filename: tile_digital_cover %}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>

      {%- if render_count > products_per_page -%}
        <button type="button" class="theinmag-shop-grid__show-more" data-show-more>
          Show more
        </button>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="theinmag-shop-grid__feedback" data-shop-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
    {%- else -%}
      <p class="theinmag-shop-grid__empty">{{ empty_text }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    Membership picker popup. Rendered once per page. Triggered by the
    "Join the club" CTA on the Membership tile (set in bundle-tile.liquid
    when product.handle == 'membership' and tile_context == 'shop').
    Snippet silently no-ops if the membership product isn't found.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {% render 'theinmag-membership-popup', membership_product: all_products['membership'] %}
</section>

{%- if render_count > 0 -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "ItemList",
    "name": {{ heading | json }},
    "numberOfItems": {{ render_count }},
    "itemListElement": [
      {%- assign ld_position = 0 -%}
      {%- for key in sorted_keys -%}
        {%- assign key_handle = key | split: ':' | last -%}
        {%- assign product = all_products[key_handle] -%}
        {%- if product == blank or product.id == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign ld_position = ld_position | plus: 1 -%}
        {%- if ld_position > 1 %},{% endif -%}
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": {{ ld_position }},
          "url": {{ shop.url | append: '/products/' | append: product.handle | json }},
          "name": {{ product.title | json }}{% if product.featured_image %},
          "image": {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 | prepend: 'https:' | json }}{% endif %},
          "offers": {
            "@type": "Offer",
            "price": "{{ product.price | money_without_currency | strip_html | strip }}",
            "priceCurrency": {{ cart.currency.iso_code | json }},
            "availability": "{% if product.available %}https://schema.org/InStock{% else %}https://schema.org/OutOfStock{% endif %}"
          }
        }
      {%- endfor -%}
    ]
  }
</script>
{%- endif -%}

<script>
  (function () {
    const root = document.querySelector('[data-theinmag-shop-grid]');
    if (!root) return;

    const list = root.querySelector('[data-shop-grid-list]');
    const filterPills = root.querySelectorAll('[data-format-filter]');
    const sortSelect = root.querySelector('[data-sort]');
    const showMoreBtn = root.querySelector('[data-show-more]');
    const visibleCount = root.querySelector('[data-visible-count]');
    const feedback = root.querySelector('[data-shop-feedback]');

    /* ----- Shared reorder: applies current sort + filter to the tile list.
       Featured order is the default tile-index, except under the Print
       filter where featured uses tile-print-index (promoted handles slot
       up so still-in-stock back-catalogue mags don't get stranded at the
       bottom). After reorder, the hidden attribute is re-applied to the
       last N items so Show-more's visible-count stays consistent even if
       a previously-hidden tile would now sort into the visible range. */
    function applyOrder() {
      const fmt = list.getAttribute('data-active-format') || 'all';
      const sort = sortSelect ? sortSelect.value : 'featured';
      const items = Array.prototype.slice.call(list.querySelectorAll('.theinmag-shop-grid__item'));
      const visibleCountVal = items.filter(function (it) { return !it.hasAttribute('hidden'); }).length;

      items.sort(function (a, b) {
        if (sort === 'price-asc') {
          return parseInt(a.dataset.productPrice, 10) - parseInt(b.dataset.productPrice, 10);
        }
        if (sort === 'price-desc') {
          return parseInt(b.dataset.productPrice, 10) - parseInt(a.dataset.productPrice, 10);
        }
        if (sort === 'newest') {
          return parseInt(b.dataset.productCreated, 10) - parseInt(a.dataset.productCreated, 10);
        }
        /* featured: tile-print-index under Print filter, tile-index otherwise */
        const indexAttr = fmt === 'print' ? 'tilePrintIndex' : 'tileIndex';
        return parseInt(a.dataset[indexAttr], 10) - parseInt(b.dataset[indexAttr], 10);
      });

      items.forEach(function (item, idx) {
        list.appendChild(item);
        if (idx < visibleCountVal) {
          item.removeAttribute('hidden');
        } else {
          item.setAttribute('hidden', '');
        }
      });
    }

    /* ----- Format filter: toggle data-active-format + reorder ----- */
    filterPills.forEach(function (pill) {
      pill.addEventListener('click', function () {
        const fmt = pill.getAttribute('data-format-filter');
        if (!fmt) return;
        list.setAttribute('data-active-format', fmt);
        filterPills.forEach(function (p) {
          p.setAttribute('aria-pressed', p === pill ? 'true' : 'false');
        });
        applyOrder();
      });
    });

    /* ----- Sort: re-order <li> children by data attributes ----- */
    if (sortSelect) {
      sortSelect.addEventListener('change', applyOrder);
    }

    /* ----- Show more: reveal the next N hidden items ----- */
    if (showMoreBtn) {
      showMoreBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        const hidden = list.querySelectorAll('.theinmag-shop-grid__item[hidden]');
        const reveal = Math.min(12, hidden.length);
        for (var i = 0; i < reveal; i++) {
          hidden[i].removeAttribute('hidden');
        }
        const stillHidden = list.querySelectorAll('.theinmag-shop-grid__item[hidden]').length;
        if (stillHidden === 0) {
          showMoreBtn.setAttribute('hidden', '');
        }
        if (visibleCount) {
          const visible = list.querySelectorAll('.theinmag-shop-grid__item:not([hidden])').length;
          visibleCount.textContent = visible;
        }
      });
    }

    /* ----- AJAX add-to-cart for shop tiles ----- */
    function flashFeedback(message) {
      if (!feedback) return;
      feedback.textContent = message;
      feedback.removeAttribute('hidden');
      clearTimeout(feedback._timer);
      feedback._timer = setTimeout(function () {
        feedback.setAttribute('hidden', '');
      }, 2400);
    }

    function flipButton(btn, success) {
      const addLabel = btn.querySelector('[data-add-label]');
      const addedLabel = btn.querySelector('[data-added-label]');
      if (!addLabel || !addedLabel) return;
      if (success) {
        addLabel.setAttribute('hidden', '');
        addedLabel.removeAttribute('hidden');
        clearTimeout(btn._flipTimer);
        btn._flipTimer = setTimeout(function () {
          addedLabel.setAttribute('hidden', '');
          addLabel.removeAttribute('hidden');
        }, 1800);
      } else {
        addLabel.textContent = 'Try again';
        clearTimeout(btn._flipTimer);
        btn._flipTimer = setTimeout(function () {
          addLabel.textContent = 'Add';
        }, 2200);
      }
    }

    function refreshCartCount(productTitle) {
      /* Refresh the storefront's cart count badge + publish cartUpdate
         so the sitewide floating pill (theinmag-floating-cart) picks
         up the new count and total. Falls back to direct DOM update
         if pub/sub isn't loaded. */
      fetch('/cart.js', { headers: { Accept: 'application/json' } })
        .then(function (r) { return r.json(); })
        .then(function (cart) {
          document.querySelectorAll('[data-cart-count]').forEach(function (el) {
            el.textContent = cart.item_count;
          });
          document.body.setAttribute('data-theinmag-cart-count', cart.item_count);
          document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('cart:updated', { detail: cart }));
          if (typeof publish === 'function' && typeof PUB_SUB_EVENTS !== 'undefined') {
            publish(PUB_SUB_EVENTS.cartUpdate, {
              source: 'theinmag-shop-grid',
              cartData: cart,
              productTitle: productTitle || ''
            });
          }
        })
        .catch(function () { /* swallow - graceful degradation */ });
    }

    list.addEventListener('click', function (event) {
      const btn = event.target.closest('[data-shop-add]');
      if (!btn) return;
      event.preventDefault();
      const variantId = btn.getAttribute('data-variant-id');
      if (!variantId) return;
      if (btn._pending) return;
      btn._pending = true;

      /* Build sections payload so the response carries fresh
         cart-drawer + cart-icon-bubble HTML. Then we can hand
         that straight to cartDrawer.renderContents and the drawer
         slides in pre-populated - same flow Dawn's product-form.js
         uses on PDPs. */
      var cartDrawer = document.querySelector('cart-drawer');
      var sectionIds = cartDrawer && typeof cartDrawer.getSectionsToRender === 'function'
        ? cartDrawer.getSectionsToRender().map(function (s) { return s.id; }).join(',')
        : '';

      const body = new FormData();
      body.append('id', variantId);
      body.append('quantity', '1');
      if (sectionIds) {
        body.append('sections', sectionIds);
        body.append('sections_url', window.location.pathname);
      }

      fetch('/cart/add.js', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { Accept: 'application/json', 'X-Requested-With': 'XMLHttpRequest' },
        body: body
      })
        .then(function (r) {
          if (!r.ok) throw new Error('Add failed');
          return r.json();
        })
        .then(function (data) {
          flipButton(btn, true);
          /* Toast is owned by the sitewide floating cart (it subscribes to the
             cartUpdate published in refreshCartCount and pops a single toast
             above the pill). Don't flash a second one here - that was the
             duplicate bubble. flashFeedback stays for the error path only. */
          refreshCartCount(data.product_title);

          /* Drawer pop. Per Ryan's Stage 6 brief: ADD TO CART ->
             drawer slides out -> Check out is one tap away. Skip
             only if cart_type isn't drawer or the drawer element
             isn't on the page. */
          if (cartDrawer && data.sections && typeof cartDrawer.renderContents === 'function') {
            cartDrawer.renderContents(data);
          }
        })
        .catch(function () {
          flipButton(btn, false);
          flashFeedback('Could not add to cart. Try again.');
        })
        .finally(function () {
          setTimeout(function () { btn._pending = false; }, 600);
        });
    });
  })();
</script>

{%- stylesheet -%}
  .theinmag-shop-grid {
    position: relative;
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    /* Horizontal padding bumped 17 May from 16px -> 24px -> 32px min
       so the single-column tiles sit comfortably back from the screen
       edge on Pixel 6. Scales up via 6vw to a 48px max on desktop. */
    padding: var(--tsg-pt, 48px) clamp(32px, 6vw, 48px) var(--tsg-pb, 96px);
    /* Defensive clip - some descendant (likely a tile image or grid
       cell) is pushing past the section's right edge on mobile, eating
       the right gutter while the left holds firm. Clipping here
       restores the symmetric padding that the rule above specifies. */
    overflow-x: clip;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__inner {
    max-width: 1320px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ---------- Head row (heading + controls) ---------- */

  .theinmag-shop-grid__head {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    position: relative;
  }

  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .theinmag-shop-grid__head {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__heading {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__controls {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .theinmag-shop-grid__controls {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }
  }

  /* Format filter pills */
  .theinmag-shop-grid__filters {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__filter-label {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    opacity: 0.78;
    margin-right: 4px;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__filter-pill {
    appearance: none;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill, 9999px);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-hover, 0.2s ease), color var(--transition-hover, 0.2s ease);
    min-height: 36px;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__filter-pill[aria-pressed='true'] {
    background-color: var(--color-yellow);
    border-color: var(--color-yellow);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__filter-pill:hover,
  .theinmag-shop-grid__filter-pill:focus-visible {
    background-color: rgba(249, 194, 60, 0.2);
    outline: none;
  }

  /* Sort dropdown */
  .theinmag-shop-grid__sort {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__sort-label {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    opacity: 0.78;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__sort-select {
    appearance: none;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 8px 32px 8px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill, 9999px);
    cursor: pointer;
    min-height: 36px;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 12 12' fill='%232A1F3D'><path d='M3 4l3 4 3-4z'/></svg>");
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: right 12px center;
    background-size: 10px;
  }

  /* Count line */
  .theinmag-shop-grid__count {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    opacity: 0.78;
  }

  /* ---------- Grid layout ---------- */

  /* Breakpoint ladder locked 17 May after the mobile tiles were reading
     squashed in 2-column at 400px viewport (Add button + price + label
     fighting for ~140px of inner row width). Single column under 600px
     gives each tile the full width so the kid-art cover breathes and
     the picker row has room. Two cols 600-749px (small tablet), three
     at 750-1199px, four at 1200+. */
  .theinmag-shop-grid__list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .theinmag-shop-grid__list {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .theinmag-shop-grid__list {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 28px;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1200px) {
    .theinmag-shop-grid__list {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 32px;
    }
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__item {
    display: flex;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__item[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__item > .theinmag-bundle-tile {
    flex: 1;
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* Empty state */
  .theinmag-shop-grid__empty {
    margin: var(--space-xl) auto;
    max-width: 480px;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    opacity: 0.78;
  }

  /* Show more button */
  .theinmag-shop-grid__show-more {
    display: block;
    margin: var(--space-xl) auto 0;
    appearance: none;
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 12px 28px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill, 9999px);
    cursor: pointer;
    min-height: 44px;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-hover, 0.2s ease), color var(--transition-hover, 0.2s ease);
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__show-more:hover,
  .theinmag-shop-grid__show-more:focus-visible {
    background-color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    color: var(--color-cream);
    outline: none;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__show-more[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  /* Feedback toast (accessibility live region for add-to-cart status).
     Styled to match the membership PDP's floating order-summary card -
     cream surface, soft-pink border, deep shadow, dark text. The dark
     inky-purple pill the toast originally used read as a generic
     system notification, not a theINmag moment. */
  .theinmag-shop-grid__feedback {
    position: fixed;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: calc(clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px) + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background-color: rgba(251, 246, 234, 0.96);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-soft-pink);
    border-radius: 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.22), 0 4px 12px rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.10);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    z-index: 60;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
    max-width: min(420px, calc(100vw - 32px));
    /* Flex so the ::before chip aligns to the text middle, not the
       baseline (vertical-align hacks were leaving the tick sitting
       low relative to the cap-height of "Added to cart"). */
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    width: max-content;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__feedback:not([hidden]) {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  /* Tiny sage check chip to soften the message. Flex item of the
     parent so vertical alignment is automatic. */
  .theinmag-shop-grid__feedback::before {
    content: '✓';
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: var(--color-sage-dark);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .theinmag-shop-grid__feedback[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }


  /* ---------- Tile styles (paired with theinmag-bundle-tile.liquid).
     Copied from theinmag-bundle-picker.liquid so the tile renders identically
     in /shop where the bundle picker section is not present. Keep these two
     stylesheet blocks in sync if the tile visual ever changes.
     ----------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .theinmag-bundle-tile {
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-soft-pink, #F7A092);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 20px);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
  }

  /* Shop-context tiles use a white card surface so each tile lifts cleanly
     off the cream page. The BaB picker keeps its cream tile (its own copy
     of this CSS lives in theinmag-bundle-picker.liquid). */
  .theinmag-bundle-tile--shop {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__cover {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    background-color: var(--color-lavender);
    overflow: hidden;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__cover img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__cover-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E8DEEF 0%, #FCDDB8 100%);
  }

  /* Shop-context: full-cover anchor link + image swap */
  .theinmag-bundle-tile__cover-link {
    display: block;
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__cover-img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-hover, 0.2s ease);
  }

  /* Default: print cover visible, digital hidden */
  .theinmag-bundle-tile__cover-img--digital {
    opacity: 0;
  }

  /* Grid filter = digital: swap visibility */
  .theinmag-shop-grid__list[data-active-format='digital'] .theinmag-bundle-tile__cover-img--print {
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .theinmag-shop-grid__list[data-active-format='digital'] .theinmag-bundle-tile__cover-img--digital {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  /* Title row (shop context): just the issue title now. The pre-sale /
     current-issue label lives on a dark-scrim ribbon over the cover
     (.theinmag-bundle-tile__ribbon below) - white-on-scrim, so it stays
     brand-safe over the artwork (no coloured pills on photos). */
  .theinmag-bundle-tile__title-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 10px 12px 6px;
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__title-row .theinmag-bundle-tile__title-link {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__title-row .theinmag-bundle-tile__title {
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Pre-sale / current-issue ribbon - overlays the cover, bottom-right.
     White text on a dark scrim (NOT a coloured pill) - the brand-safe way
     to label over cover artwork (no-pills-on-photos rule). Same data-driven
     logic as before (product is never both, so they never collide). */
  .theinmag-bundle-tile__ribbon {
    position: absolute;
    right: 10px;
    bottom: 10px;
    z-index: 2;
    pointer-events: none;
    background-color: rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.9);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
  }

  /* Pre-sale variant stacks the label over the drop date so buyers see
     up front that the issue ships on release day, not immediately. */
  .theinmag-bundle-tile__ribbon--presale {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 1px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    white-space: normal;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__ribbon-sub {
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__title {
    margin: 10px 12px 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__title-link {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__title-link:hover .theinmag-bundle-tile__title,
  .theinmag-bundle-tile__title-link:focus-visible .theinmag-bundle-tile__title {
    color: var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A);
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__row.is-sold-out {
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__format { font-weight: 500; }
  .theinmag-bundle-tile__price { font-weight: 500; color: rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.78); text-align: right; }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__pill {
    grid-column: 2 / -1;
    justify-self: end;
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-peach);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill, 9999px);
    color: var(--color-sandy-orange-dark, #D9783A);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__add {
    appearance: none;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A);
    color: var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A);
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill, 9999px);
    cursor: pointer;
    min-height: 36px;
    /* Sized to fit "Added ✓" without resize so the surrounding tile
       row doesn't shift when the label flips on AJAX-add. */
    min-width: 88px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: background-color var(--transition-hover, 0.2s ease), color var(--transition-hover, 0.2s ease);
  }

  .theinmag-bundle-tile__add:hover,
  .theinmag-bundle-tile__add:focus-visible {
    background-color: var(--color-purple-dark, #5D3A7A);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    outline: none;
  }

  /* Membership-only CTA. Replaces the Print/Digital rows on the Membership
     tile and opens the picker popup. Yellow stamp colour (CTA-only per
     brand rules), full-width within the tile footer. */
  .theinmag-bundle-tile__join {
    appearance: none;
    background-color: var(--color-yellow);
    border: none;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy);
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    margin: 8px 12px 12px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill, 9999px);
    cursor: pointer;
    min-height: 44px;
    transition: filter 0.2s ease;
  }
  .theinmag-bundle-tile__join:hover,
  .theinmag-bundle-tile__join:focus-visible {
    filter: brightness(0.94);
    outline: none;
  }

  /* Optional kid-character peek (schema-toggled, used on the stockist
     hub picker). Desktop only, anchored to the head row and lifted into
     the blank space above the Sort control, top-right. */
  .theinmag-shop-grid__character {
    display: none;
  }
  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .theinmag-shop-grid__character {
      display: block;
      position: absolute;
      right: clamp(0px, 1vw, 12px);
      bottom: calc(100% + 2px);
      width: clamp(76px, 6.5vw, 100px);
      z-index: 3;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .theinmag-bundle-tile__add,
    .theinmag-bundle-tile__join,
    .theinmag-bundle-tile__cover-img,
    .theinmag-shop-grid__filter-pill,
    .theinmag-shop-grid__show-more {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
{%- endstylesheet -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Shop grid",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "shopify-section theinmag-shop-grid-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Filterable product grid for /shop. Renders the configured collection via the bundle-tile snippet (shop context). Format filter is COVER-ONLY (swaps the visible cover image, does not filter the list). Sort + Show-more are client-side."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Shop everything"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection_handle",
      "label": "Collection to render"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "exclude_handles",
      "label": "Product handles to hide",
      "info": "Comma-separated product handles to skip in the grid. Default hides the deprecated single-mags / single-issues umbrella product.",
      "default": "single-mags, single-issues"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cover_overrides",
      "label": "Cover overrides",
      "info": "Comma-separated handle:filename pairs. The grid tile for that handle shows the named /assets/ image as its cover instead of the product's featured image.",
      "default": "membership:membershipimage.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "digital_cover_overrides",
      "label": "Digital cover overrides",
      "info": "Comma-separated handle:filename pairs. Used when a product has no single_mag.digital_media_images metafield - shows the named /assets/ image under the Digital filter.",
      "default": "membership:membership-hero-digital.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "print_promote_handles",
      "label": "Print-promoted handles",
      "info": "Comma-separated product handles. Under the Print filter, these tiles jump up the grid to a slot just below the most recent issues (so back-catalogue mags we still have print stock for don't get stranded at the bottom). Cover-only filter; the tile list itself is unchanged.",
      "default": "mag01"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Stockist / print-only mode"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "print_available_only",
      "label": "Print-available only",
      "info": "Only show products that have an available, non-digital variant. Hides digital-only mags, print-sold-out issues and the Digital Stack; keeps in-stock print mags, the Snack Pack and pre-sales. Used on the /pages/instock stockist hub. Still exclude Membership via 'Product handles to hide'.",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_format_filter",
      "label": "Show the Print/Digital filter pills",
      "info": "Turn off on an all-print page (e.g. the stockist hub) where the format filter has nothing to do.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_character",
      "label": "Show a random kid-character peek (desktop)",
      "info": "Pops a random character from the sitewide pool, top-right above the Sort control. Desktop only. Used on the stockist hub.",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Custom order anchors"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Grid order is: Membership, Snack Pack, mags newest-first, any other product, then Digital Stack last. The three values below are matched against each product's title (case-sensitive, partial match) to anchor that order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "membership_match",
      "label": "Membership - title contains",
      "default": "Membership"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "snack_pack_match",
      "label": "Snack Pack - title contains",
      "default": "Snack Pack"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "digital_stack_match",
      "label": "Digital Stack - title contains",
      "default": "Digital Stack"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "products_per_page",
      "label": "Initial products visible",
      "min": 4,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 4,
      "default": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "empty_text",
      "label": "Empty state text",
      "default": "No mags available right now. Check back soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Spacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "label": "Padding top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 128,
      "step": 4,
      "default": 48,
      "unit": "px"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "label": "Padding bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 128,
      "step": 4,
      "default": 96,
      "unit": "px"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Shop grid" }
  ],
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["page"]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
